:: Test N

{=

(metadata: "title", "Test N (spindle convo)")

[[⇦ BACK->Pre-Test (NEW)]]

<br>
The `($funcSpindleConvo:)` macro has 3 modes, each producing different exitLink behaviors. Please select them:
(set: _mode to 0)
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "1 - exitLink appears at the beginning.", "mode1",
    "2 - exitLink appears after 1 turn.", "mode2",
    "3 - exitLink appears when all choices have been exhausted.", "mode3",
))
<br>

|mode1)[(set:_mode to 1)(show:?convo)]
|mode2)[(set:_mode to 2)(show:?convo)]
|mode3)[(set:_mode to 3)(show:?convo)]

|convo)[($funcSpindleConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->\"Hello!\"", "hello",
    "<!--B-->\"How goes it?\"", "howGoes",
    "<!--C-->\"What's the weather like?\"", "fineDay",
    "<!--D-->\"I'm done with small talk\"", "exitLink",
), _mode)]


(set: _hello to [{Ni hao fine shyte.}])
(set: _howGoes to [{It's fine, I guess.}])
(set: _fineDay to [{It's (print: $place's weather).}])
(set: _exitLink to [{Yeah, alright.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "How about a game of chess?", "chess"
))
<br>
}])

[Sounds good.
